rale a n\u00e9cessit\u00e9 5000 heures de travail graphique, guid\u00e9 par des historiens.\nDe la nef \u00e0 la fl\u00e8che, admirez chaque perspective du monument, et finissez par un spectaculaire voyage en ballon au-dessus des arches, et de Paris \u00e0 la fin du XVIII\u00e8me si\u00e8cle. Le tout au son d\u2019une fantaisie de Bach jou\u00e9e sur le c\u00e9l\u00e8bre orgue Cavaill\u00e9-Coll !", "short_description": "Ubisoft propose une visite en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle de Notre-Dame de Paris \u00e0 partir de la reconstitution du XVIII\u00e8me si\u00e8cle extraite du jeu Assassin\u2019s Creed : Unity."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Mobile_Icon_EN.png", "id": "5505549282843861", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031325_5505549292843860_5100780693875841273_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=E6pJ4e03slQQ7kNvwGCdIY4&_nc_oc=Adprqy7g1ghIKSSvNJ17h6YrdbVBn6srFH0uSK81VfgcGk1yVyz4rOaWH0HG7YUV9Ho&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSkuEj2ZesgpN1GFBmuOT7SQap4qwYc3E9CnLHGCb5xCQ&oe=6B05C078"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_EN.png", "id": "2626086864190393", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031371_2626086867523726_7267842356612940618_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=evwYzNqBkeAQ7kNvwFk9mJJ&_nc_oc=Adpu3WZ_N4XiDXZfgg1KL99ffWxqa5IlHeFHA5xS1PcSyMe-rEyhscawZBjvSOB7chk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTLFYnW5IfyZF4k6RUV77ekgLqEkCVA1MeRQhyJMbBrLw&oe=6B05B0D8"}, {"file_name": "VR_Landscape_EN.png", "id": "1543686999397216", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031515_1543687002730549_2548295266512135503_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=63dfTqqa_4sQ7kNvwG0oOlD&_nc_oc=AdpmMfbSC50ZLNySbSnpjZLgusINGjrcOKQ